2026-07-27T07:45:19.0666518Z Start test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
2026-07-27T07:45:19.0713549Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T07:45:19.0714241Z i /tmp/Rtmpfw55dx/duckdb
2026-07-27T07:45:19.0714719Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T07:45:19.0715246Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T07:45:19.0716067Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T07:45:19.0716856Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T07:45:19.0717844Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T07:45:19.0718574Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T07:45:19.0945165Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:45:19.1048794Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:45:19.1430370Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:45:19.1562311Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
